      "narration_text": "Claude Code is an agentic system. The loop is the product. Gather, act, verify, repeat — the loop can complete three, four, five steps before the output buffer flushes to your terminal. The explanation and the file changes are happening at the same time, in the same loop, because that is the design. The loop is what makes Claude Code useful for complex multi-step work.",
