      "t_start": 83.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 12.0,
      "narration_text": "Here is where this bites. The loop's autonomy is what makes Claude Code powerful for multi-step classroom builds — generating a grading tool, building a simulation, building three pages at once. But a loop that runs unsupervised on a project you care about can modify things you did not intend to touch, install dependencies your school server cannot serve, change a config that breaks a different project.",
