      "t_start": 95.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 12.0,
      "narration_text": "The practical move: use plan mode for any first session on a project and for any operation whose failure would cost more than 30 seconds to undo. Press Shift+Tab twice. Read the plan. Use Ctrl+G to open it in your editor and remove what you did not ask for. Then approve. The loop runs only what you approved.",
