      "t_start": 107.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 12.0,
      "narration_text": "The agentic loop is what makes Claude Code more than a better chatbot. The loop reads your project, executes a plan across many files, verifies the result — and does it without you managing each step. Plan mode is not overhead. It is the dial that lets you choose how much of the loop to supervise on any given task.",
