    {
      "beat_id": "B12",
      "t_start": 119.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 10.0,
      "narration_text": "The agentic loop acts before you finish reading because that is what makes it useful. Plan mode exists because useful is not the same as supervised. Shift+Tab twice, read the plan, edit what does not belong. Then let the loop run.",
